{"title":"2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2b Part i","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2b\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2b</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2b\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2b\" title=\"2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2b\">Problem 2b</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2b\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2b2dbafd325dc8a379b8969f332a479e0bc9068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n, n + 1, n + 2, n + 3, n + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"214\" height=\"17\" /> are five consecutive integers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2b_Part_i&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine a simplified expression for the sum of these five consecutive integers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2b_Part_i&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/9069b962de99cbf88c926007d520686f835c89e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n + n + 1 + n + 2 + n + 3 + n + 4 = 2n + 1 + 2n + 5 + n + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"484\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/4/0c41bb6f425eceecfab8fd0f48a7fce7647a6923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4n + 6 + n + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/4/0048eea0c1c128128de43486904a7eaa27d66f99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{5n + 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"93\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017223258\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 second